        {
          "name": "reason",
          "value": "UNSUPPORTED(generator capability): the generator emits `args: [...]` but Ash.CustomExpression.__using__/1 raises ArgumentError unless `arguments:` is given, so every module this task produces fails to compile. Manufacturing it would poison every later compile boundary. ggen_igniter refuses the morphism rather than hand-writing the module or patching upstream output."
        },
